      ⍝ Regression (Blake McBride, Bugs22 #3): ¯12○B (and the latent
      ⍝ ¯8○B) discarded do_bif_circle_fun()'s ErrorCode and always
      ⍝ reported success, so an overflowing result silently became 0
      ⍝ instead of DOMAIN ERROR.
